    "text": "Line <math> <mtext>L</mtext> </math> has intercepts <math> <mtext>a</mtext> </math> and <math> <mtext>b</mtext> </math> on the coordinate axes, when the axes are rotated through a given angle keeping the origin fixed, the same line has intercepts <math> <mtext>p</mtext> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mtext>q,</mtext></mrow> </math> then"
